<title>UK: BOE allots 440 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 440 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 440 million stg of assistance in early operations on Thursday.</p>
<p>It allotted 30 million stg in bills outright, maturing on or before May 2 and 410 million stg in repos to May 1 and 2.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Bank forecast a money market shortage of 1.05 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
